dbpane

dbpane is a modified work of dbx (https://github.com/t8y2/dbx), distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It is built from a fork of
dbx, https://github.com/rutaks/dbx, branch dbx-tui.

What changed from dbx: the fork adds one crate, crates/dbx-tui, which is the
dbpane terminal client (a new head on dbx's core, beside the desktop app), and
lists it as a member of the workspace in Cargo.toml (with the matching entries
in Cargo.lock). No other dbx source file is modified. The dbx crates are used
as libraries, unchanged.

Theme: the colour roles and the default and terminal themes in
crates/dbx-tui/src/app/theme.rs are derived from herdr
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache-2.0, v0.9.5, commit ee5bfb5. The
layout and look of the client follow herdr's.

dbx's own NOTICE follows.

